    {
        "Id": 969927034,
        "Type": 3,
        "UiType": 1,
        "Name": "The Pseudo-Unwinged",
        "Text": "Ah, Christina, I was wondering where to find you. ...What happened to your frame?",
        "Duration": 3
    },
    {
        "Id": 969927035,
        "Type": 3,
        "UiType": 1,
        "Name": "The Pseudo-Unwinged",
        "Text": "I'll tear you apart along with this fake sky!",
        "Duration": 3
    },
    {
        "Id": 969927036,
        "Type": 3,
        "UiType": 1,
        "Name": "The Pseudo-Unwinged",
        "Text": "The wind does not falter... I shall return...",
        "Duration": 3
    },
    {
        "Id": 969927037,
        "Type": 3,
        "UiType": 1,
        "Name": "The Pseudo-Unwinged",
        "Text": "You should not have opposed me. Now, repent for your folly!",
        "Duration": 3
    },
    {
        "Id": 969927038,
        "Type": 3,
        "UiType": 1,
        "Name": "The Pseudo-Unwinged",
        "Text": "Now, repent for your folly.",
        "Duration": 3
    },
    {
        "Id": 969927039,
        "Type": 3,
        "UiType": 1,
        "Name": "The Pseudo-Unwinged",
        "Text": "I saw through you Normans long ago... Hypocrites and liars! Daring to chase after a ghost!",
        "Duration": 3
    },
    {
        "Id": 969927040,
        "Type": 3,
        "UiType": 1,
        "Name": "The Pseudo-Unwinged",
        "Text": "Let me witness it... your so-called resolve!",
        "Duration": 3
    },
    {
        "Id": 969927041,
        "Type": 3,
        "UiType": 1,
        "Name": "The Pseudo-Unwinged",
        "Text": "You know, I met your father once. Heh, what a spineless coward.",
        "Duration": 3
    },
    {
        "Id": 969927042,
        "Type": 3,
        "UiType": 1,
        "Name": "The Pseudo-Unwinged",
        "Text": "You cannot possibly imagine... the future I have foreseen!",
        "Duration": 3
    },
    {
        "Id": 969927043,
        "Type": 3,
        "UiType": 1,
        "Name": "The Pseudo-Unwinged",
        "Text": "Your self-righteous display of justice... It sickens me.",
        "Duration": 3
    },
    {
        "Id": 969927044,
        "Type": 3,
        "UiType": 1,
        "Name": "The Pseudo-Unwinged",
        "Text": "Now I see what you've become... I will never accept this!",
        "Duration": 3
    },
    {
        "Id": 969927045,
        "Type": 3,
        "UiType": 1,
        "Name": "The Pseudo-Unwinged",
        "Text": "I have become a green-eyed demon, only to drag you all down to hell!",
        "Duration": 3
    },
